#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "29 May 2026 {#29-may-2026}"
msgstr "29 Mei 2026 {#29-may-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qiskit Code Assistant service discontinued** - The preview service has been discontinued and the Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab extensions have been archived.\n"
msgstr "**Layanan Qiskit Code Assistant dihentikan** - Layanan pratinjau telah dihentikan dan ekstensi Visual Studio Code serta JupyterLab telah diarsipkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr "  Berdasarkan umpan balik dan pola penggunaan, semakin banyak pengguna yang menjalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant secara lokal dan bekerja di integrasi editor yang sudah menjadi bagian dari alur kerja pengembangan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Qiskit Code Assistant models remain available for local use. See the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr "  Model Qiskit Code Assistant tetap tersedia untuk penggunaan lokal. Lihat dokumentasi [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Pembaruan sebelumnya {#previous-updates}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 October 2025 {#28-october-2025}"
msgstr "28 Oktober 2025 {#28-october-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have updated the model available in the service to the newer `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model\n"
msgstr "Kami telah memperbarui model yang tersedia di layanan ini ke model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` yang lebih baru\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have open-sourced two new models for local inference in Hugging Face:\n"
msgstr "Kami telah membuka sumber (open-source) dua model baru untuk inferensi lokal di Hugging Face:\n"

